  "body": "All the spec’s citations to RFC 2119 as a reference in the References\r\nsection were removed in the 4ac633e refactoring related to the Infra\r\nStandard. But one place remains in the spec that should have already\r\nincluded a citation to RFC 2119 as a reference in the References\r\nsection. So this change adds that where it should be.\r\n\r\nThe lack of this is causing the build to emit a `Warning: Unused reference: [RFC2119]` message.",
